              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p>WAKAYA ALYAWARRE</p>
                  <p>All that land in the Northern Territory comprising the whole of Northern Territory Portions 8009 and 8383 delineated on Survey Plans S2022/073A and S2022/073B lodged with the Surveyor-General, Darwin, and containing an area of approximately 484,000 hectares.</p>
                  <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
                  <p><i>Senate on 15 August 2024</i></p>
                  <p><i>House of Representatives on 27 November 2024</i>]</p>
                  <p>(98/24)</p>
                </content>
